  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACTIONAID INTERNATIONAL SWEDEN - BANGLADESH, VIETNAM &amp; UKRAINA (CSO 2025-2029)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ACTIONAID INTERNATIONAL SWEDEN - BANGLADESH, VIETNAM &amp; UKRAINA (CSO 2025-2029)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen har tv&#xe5; delar. 1) St&#xf6;d till att st&#xe4;rka kvinnor och unga samt CSO i Bangladesh och Vietnam att arbeta med DRR - Disaster Risk Reduction vad g&#xe4;ller klimat och milj&#xf6;. 2) I Ukraina st&#xf6;djer insatsen kvinnor och unga (Women Led Organisations och Women&apos;s Rights Organisations) att bli mer aktiva i beslut som ber&#xf6;r rekonstruktionen av Ukraina samt Ukrainas n&#xe4;rmande till EU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution has two components. 1) Support for women and youth organisations in Bangladesh and Vietnam to more capable in DRR (Disaster Risk Reducation) relating to environment and climate. 2) Support to Women Led and Women&#xe4;s Rights Organisations in Ukraina, in order to strengthen the ability to reconstruct Ukraine, and also increase Ukraine&apos;s capacity to approach EU.</narrative>
  </description>
